@startuml SEQ_03_LUPA_RESET_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-03: Lupa & Reset Password

actor       "Publik"                      as Publik
boundary    "Browser"                     as Browser
control     "PasswordResetLinkController" as CtrlLink
control     "NewPasswordController"       as CtrlReset
entity      "User Model"                  as Model
collections "Mail"                        as Mail

== Request Link Reset Password ==

Publik  -> Browser   : Akses /forgot-password

Browser -> CtrlLink  : GET /forgot-password
CtrlLink --> Browser : Render form input email
Browser --> Publik   : Tampil form input email

Publik  -> Browser   : Isi email, klik Kirim Link Reset

Browser -> CtrlLink  : POST /forgot-password {email}

CtrlLink -> Model    : Password::sendResetLink({email})
Model --> CtrlLink : Hasil query
Model -> Mail        : Kirim email berisi link reset password
Mail --> Publik      : Email reset dikirim ke inbox
CtrlLink --> Browser : Tampil pesan link reset telah dikirim
Browser --> Publik   : Tampil pesan sukses

== Reset Password via Token ==

Publik  -> Browser    : Klik link di email (/reset-password/{token})

Browser -> CtrlReset  : GET /reset-password/{token}
CtrlReset --> Browser : Render form reset password
Browser --> Publik    : Tampil form reset password

Publik  -> Browser    : Isi password baru + konfirmasi, klik Reset

Browser -> CtrlReset  : POST /reset-password {token, email, password}

CtrlReset -> Model    : Password::reset({email, password, token})
Model --> CtrlReset   : Berhasil
CtrlReset --> Browser : Redirect ke halaman Login
Browser --> Publik    : Redirect ke Login + pesan password berhasil direset

@enduml